From dca0e48dce7db0e577bb36b252e18b726fa8fd41 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: greyoak111 <151205158+greyoak111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 04:28:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 26/51] Add floating danmaku chat window

A frameless window with the live feed and send box, opened from the
dock or a hotkey. It can stay on top, be pinned in place, run at
50-100% opacity, and is left out of OBS's screen capture unless the
user allows it.

mac-capture asks the host through the global procedure
hide_obs_window_exceptions for windows to keep visible while Hide OBS
is on and windows to leave out while it is off, and rebuilds the
stream when that list changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
