+
+/* Floating danmaku window for replying without switching to OBS.
+ *
+ * Frameless; drag the title strip to move and the corner grip to resize.
+ * "On top" keeps it above other apps, including full-screen ones; "Pin"
+ * locks its position and size. Opacity is 50-100 %. Screen capture does not
+ * see it unless "Allow screen capture" is on. All of this is remembered. */
+class FloatingChat : public QWidget {
